  "description": "ApiGuardrails for ASP.NET Core: Standardizes error contracts (RFC 7807/9457 ProblemDetails), mandatory pagination limits, security headers, rate limiting enforcement, deprecation standards (RFC 8594), OpenTelemetry metrics, and CI/CD SARIF diagnostics.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
