  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0 Release:\n- Five new standard guardrails:\n  - AG1007: Mandatory Pagination Policy (detects unbounded queries and enforces safe page sizes)\n  - AG1008: API Deprecation Standards (RFC 8594 Deprecation/Sunset headers)\n  - AG1009: Defensive Security Headers (X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, X-Frame-Options: DENY)\n  - AG1010: Rate Limiting Policy (ensures mutating/sensitive routes declare rate limits)\n  - AG1011: Content Negotiation and Media Type Validation\n- Granular per-endpoint rule suppression via [SkipGuardrail] and .SkipGuardrail()\n- Embedded interactive HTML status dashboard via MapApiGuardrailsDashboard()\n- CI/CD SARIF 2.1.0 exporter for GitHub Code Scanning via MapApiGuardrailsSarifReport()\n- Markdown summary generator via MapApiGuardrailsMarkdownReport()\n- ASP.NET Core Health Checks integration via AddApiGuardrailsHealthCheck()\n- Minimal API route-group filter support via AddApiGuardrailsFilter()",
